{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have escaped your cartoon! Play as the Doop Loops\u2122 cereal mascot with one goal \u2014 collect as many loops as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/31c16eed405de63e623cba06404ba2c1.poster.avif?t=1764817725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/31c16eed405de63e623cba06404ba2c1.webm?t=1764817725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/31c16eed405de63e623cba06404ba2c1.mp4?t=1764817725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The problem? You're hopelessly addicted to the stuff, and the Cereal Protection Task Force will do anything to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/84513a0cab65a4347ec190035547b4df.poster.avif?t=1764817725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/84513a0cab65a4347ec190035547b4df.webm?t=1764817725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/84513a0cab65a4347ec190035547b4df.mp4?t=1764817725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soooooooo.... Chuck groceries the faces of competing cereal mascots and mall cops and KEEP COLLECTING YOUR LOOPS!!!\u00a0IM LOOPY FOR DOOP LOOPS!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/e3fa044a0e7439d40c8ab315c19f488c.poster.avif?t=1764817725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/e3fa044a0e7439d40c8ab315c19f488c.webm?t=1764817725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/e3fa044a0e7439d40c8ab315c19f488c.mp4?t=1764817725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you ever do with all these loops? Pay rent to a homeless man and unlock goofy skins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/6bbefe55dbc4483ce6d63e5f9e1366b9.poster.avif?t=1764817725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/6bbefe55dbc4483ce6d63e5f9e1366b9.webm?t=1764817725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/extras/6bbefe55dbc4483ce6d63e5f9e1366b9.mp4?t=1764817725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 homeless man you feed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ hours of pure insanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 epic boss fights with cutscenes and a quirky story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique store environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ types of chuckable merchandise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ cosmetic combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ voice lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e DOOP LOOPS\u2122!!!</p></li></ul><p class=